Feature: Visual Comparison tests for return analysis chart

    Background:
        Given "Return Analysis Chart" with default settings is added to a report for portfolio "SNP100" with date "20240205"

    Scenario: Validate changes in return analysis chart with different time period settings
        # USER STORY 1393960 - show portfolio data for daily interval
        When I open widget settings modal from "Return Analysis Chart"
        And I click performance settings tab
        And I change frequency is to "Quarter"
        And I change number of periods to "2"
        And I click format tab
        And I uncheck all other columns beside portfolio column
        And I maximize widget
        And I apply widget settings
        Then "Return Analysis Chart - 2 Quarters to Date" should be displayed, aligning with the snapshot "returnsChart_port_dailyInterval"

        # USER STORY 1393960 - show portfolio data for monthly interval
        When I open widget settings modal from "Return Analysis Chart"
        And I click axis tab
        And I change time period interval to "Monthly"
        And I apply widget settings
        Then "Return Analysis Chart - 2 Quarters to Date" should be displayed, aligning with the snapshot "returnsChart_port_monthlyInterval"

        # USER STORY 1393960 - show portfolio data for quarterly interval
        When I open widget settings modal from "Return Analysis Chart"
        And I click axis tab
        And I change time period interval to "Quarterly"
        And I apply widget settings
        Then "Return Analysis Chart - 2 Quarters to Date" should be displayed, aligning with the snapshot "returnsChart_port_quarterlyInterval"
